      "content": "\"intrinsic value\" feels like such a hollow thing to say. it's just words. i'm just taking up space and consuming resources. the truth is, if i just stopped, the world wouldn't even skip a beat. i've never felt more useless than i do right now. it's like there's no reason to keep fighting for a life that doesn't even belong to me anymore.",
